<title>USA: TABLE - Intl Franchise Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Intl Franchise Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BETHESDA, Md. 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.31   profit	 $0.01</p>
<p> Net profit		 2,069   profit	    57</p>
<p> Revs			 7,055		    5,663</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   6,727		    6,727</p>
<p>	   6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.33     loss	 $0.07</p>
<p> Net profit		 2,193     loss	   442</p>
<p> Revs			13,749		   10,449</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   6,727		    6,727</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: International Franchise Systems said it reported a profit from discontinued operations of $349 in the second quarter of 1997 and a loss of $68,022 and $400,986 in the first six months of 1997 and 1996, respectively.</p>
<p>Net income for the second quarter and the first six months of 1997 included extraordinary income of $1,756,038, or $0.26 per share.</p>
